(6138335, 904101, 28742, '<td valign="top">If this was a moon challenge, I''d give it an 8. If it was a French challenge, I''d give it an 8 (assuming the title is French), but alas, this is "Rusted" and even though it might take less time to translate your title and/or try and understand your logic here than it did to type all this, I am already invested in blabbing away about why I am giving you a 3. I like the photo, though.</td>', 'If this was a moon challenge, I''d give it an 8. If it was a French challenge, I''d give it an 8 (assuming the title is French), but alas, this is "Rusted" and even though it might take less time to translate your title and/or try and understand your logic here than it did to type all this, I am already invested in blabbing away about why I am giving you a 3. I like the photo, though.', '2010-08-23 04:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
