(6142893, 904101, 119179, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how it meets the challenge but it''s a brilliant picture of the Moon ! I''ve never seen it so much in details !</td>', 'I''m not sure how it meets the challenge but it''s a brilliant picture of the Moon ! I''ve never seen it so much in details !', '2010-08-27 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143008, 904823, 119179, '<td valign="top">I would have go for a 10 with a better DOP...</td>', 'I would have go for a 10 with a better DOP...', '2010-08-27 17:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143010, 904406, 17986, '<td valign="top">I like the spider web, but I wish the depth of field was a little deeper.</td>', 'I like the spider web, but I wish the depth of field was a little deeper.', '2010-08-27 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143014, 904522, 17986, '<td valign="top">Ehh...It seems pretty out of focus but I like the subject</td>', 'Ehh...It seems pretty out of focus but I like the subject', '2010-08-27 17:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143021, 904864, 17986, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of shooting a famous icon but NOT having it be the subject. I like the colors and the composition for the most part. I only wish that it was shot with a more straight on point of view to the fence and with a little deeper depth of field so that the whole fence was in focus. It may have worked really well as a square crop as well. All in all, I like it. 7</td>', 'I like the idea of shooting a famous icon but NOT having it be the subject. I like the colors and the composition for the most part. I only wish that it was shot with a more straight on point of view to the fence and with a little deeper depth of field so that the whole fence was in focus. It may have worked really well as a square crop as well. All in all, I like it. 7', '2010-08-27 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143022, 904967, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I wish it was a little more contrasty</td>', 'Nice composition. I wish it was a little more contrasty', '2010-08-27 17:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143028, 905000, 17986, '<td valign="top">Love the color and texture here</td>', 'Love the color and texture here', '2010-08-27 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143029, 904723, 17986, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast and some whit balance in my opinion.</td>', 'Needs more contrast and some whit balance in my opinion.', '2010-08-27 17:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143031, 903978, 17986, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why I like this as much as I do, but I do!</td>', 'Don''t know why I like this as much as I do, but I do!', '2010-08-27 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143032, 904655, 17986, '<td valign="top">Like the color treatment here and the perspective! Nice capture and post potduction!</td>', 'Like the color treatment here and the perspective! Nice capture and post potduction!', '2010-08-27 17:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143036, 904174, 17986, '<td valign="top">LOVE the photo!! However in my mind, rust is not really the subject here. True there is some rust in the photo, but to me, this photo just doesn''t seem to fit for this challenge. I do love everything else about it!</td>', 'LOVE the photo!! However in my mind, rust is not really the subject here. True there is some rust in the photo, but to me, this photo just doesn''t seem to fit for this challenge. I do love everything else about it!', '2010-08-27 17:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143037, 905012, 17986, '<td valign="top">Ok, a little disturbing and not a photo I would hang in my house, but well done nonetheless. A solid 9 in my book.</td>', 'Ok, a little disturbing and not a photo I would hang in my house, but well done nonetheless. A solid 9 in my book.', '2010-08-27 17:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143038, 904742, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice macro-y sort of point-of-view shot. A great capture of rust! Nice job!</td>', 'Nice macro-y sort of point-of-view shot. A great capture of rust! Nice job!', '2010-08-27 17:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143039, 904459, 17986, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view. I like the symmetry and the colors. Nice job!</td>', 'Nice point of view. I like the symmetry and the colors. Nice job!', '2010-08-27 17:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143040, 904413, 17986, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting on this. It looks a little too flat.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting on this. It looks a little too flat.', '2010-08-27 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143042, 904655, 23484, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle on this. Neat urban acid look.</td>', 'I really like the angle on this. Neat urban acid look.', '2010-08-27 17:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143082, 904828, 117314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The angle seems a little odd.. especially on the right side of the image.</td>', 'Nice shot. The angle seems a little odd.. especially on the right side of the image.', '2010-08-27 18:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143087, 904759, 117314, '<td valign="top">lol.. wonder who is ready for the ''slight'' body work! Nice capture and good processing. The colour on the entire image, though even, is fantastic.</td>', 'lol.. wonder who is ready for the ''slight'' body work! Nice capture and good processing. The colour on the entire image, though even, is fantastic.', '2010-08-27 18:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143092, 904926, 117314, '<td valign="top">Rusted bridge for sure.. but there is just too much in the frame. May be a better angle would have been great.</td>', 'Rusted bridge for sure.. but there is just too much in the frame. May be a better angle would have been great.', '2010-08-27 18:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143098, 904812, 117314, '<td valign="top">Agreed. But there is just too much on the b/g. The attention is pretty much drawn to the beautiful top portion of the image and then to the car, truck? and only then to those rusty fence. I think this would have been very nice if you had focused it a bit closer. Anyway its a well composed picture around a rusty subject.</td>', 'Agreed. But there is just too much on the b/g. The attention is pretty much drawn to the beautiful top portion of the image and then to the car, truck? and only then to those rusty fence. I think this would have been very nice if you had focused it a bit closer. Anyway its a well composed picture around a rusty subject.', '2010-08-27 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143106, 904236, 117314, '<td valign="top">Good that you had the wood? in the frame and not just the nail. But there is nothing much in the b/g to strike something interesting. Still the wood adds to the element of composing a picture around the nail.</td>', 'Good that you had the wood? in the frame and not just the nail. But there is nothing much in the b/g to strike something interesting. Still the wood adds to the element of composing a picture around the nail.', '2010-08-27 19:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143196, 904954, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a glorious old truck!  One of my outtakes is of a very similar one. I love the styling on these.</td>', 'What a glorious old truck!  One of my outtakes is of a very similar one. I love the styling on these.', '2010-08-27 21:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143201, 904522, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off very flat looking and slightly out of focus. Not a very interesting shot, I''m afraid, though there are certainly some easy adjustments that could help this one. levels, curves, satruation, contrast and some sharpening could bump it up a notch.</td>', 'Comes off very flat looking and slightly out of focus. Not a very interesting shot, I''m afraid, though there are certainly some easy adjustments that could help this one. levels, curves, satruation, contrast and some sharpening could bump it up a notch.', '2010-08-27 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143204, 904811, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off a bit flat looking, but I think there is a lot of potential in this and a few easy and common adjustments could crank it up a notch on the DPC broad appeal scale.</td>', 'Comes off a bit flat looking, but I think there is a lot of potential in this and a few easy and common adjustments could crank it up a notch on the DPC broad appeal scale.', '2010-08-27 22:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143205, 904467, 83313, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a very slight amount of blur or some sort of softness to this that does not seem quite right to me.</td>', 'There seems to be a very slight amount of blur or some sort of softness to this that does not seem quite right to me.', '2010-08-27 22:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6143207, 904655, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your selective adjustments are highly visible where the shrub behind this goes abruptly blurry.</td>', 'Your selective adjustments are highly visible where the shrub behind this goes abruptly blurry.', '2010-08-27 22:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
