(6143221, 904759, 91783, '<td valign="top">ive seen this car twice now... and i like the other pic better. i only say this  because i think the image is too grainy...  although i  do like the colors a lot!</td>', 'ive seen this car twice now... and i like the other pic better. i only say this  because i think the image is too grainy...  although i  do like the colors a lot!', '2010-08-27 22:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
