(6143266, 904479, 75618, '<td valign="top">The stand-out in the challenge for me. The textures of the rust complement her skin really well. The orange make-up and eye shadow is a nice touch. My only tiny nitpicks are the stray hairs and the facial shadows. Outstanding entry overall. 8</td>', 'The stand-out in the challenge for me. The textures of the rust complement her skin really well. The orange make-up and eye shadow is a nice touch. My only tiny nitpicks are the stray hairs and the facial shadows. Outstanding entry overall. 8', '2010-08-28 00:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
