(6144235, 904954, 117314, '<td valign="top">Hm.. 2 of you got the same subject. Though a different angle. The colour in this is rich and vibrant.</td>', 'Hm.. 2 of you got the same subject. Though a different angle. The colour in this is rich and vibrant.', '2010-08-29 03:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144238, 904815, 117314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and good processing. Just the right amount of light makes this even more appealing. max.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and good processing. Just the right amount of light makes this even more appealing. max.', '2010-08-29 03:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144239, 905012, 117314, '<td valign="top">Sometimes when people take some things lightly, the message that is being passed on needs to be a little harsh. What a great way to pass on the message. Beautiful picture composition around the rust.</td>', 'Sometimes when people take some things lightly, the message that is being passed on needs to be a little harsh. What a great way to pass on the message. Beautiful picture composition around the rust.', '2010-08-29 03:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144301, 904101, 110876, '<td valign="top">I did some research to try and find out what the reference is here.  I''m still not sure.  It is a nice picture, but I don''t expect it to do well in this challenge.  I think that it would have helped to give it a red tint.</td>', 'I did some research to try and find out what the reference is here.  I''m still not sure.  It is a nice picture, but I don''t expect it to do well in this challenge.  I think that it would have helped to give it a red tint.', '2010-08-29 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144303, 904691, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great expression.</td>', 'Great expression.', '2010-08-29 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144307, 904972, 110876, '<td valign="top">I would expect to see more color in a challenge on rust.</td>', 'I would expect to see more color in a challenge on rust.', '2010-08-29 10:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144313, 904354, 110876, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of texture here.  I don''t think this was a good challenge to make a B&amp;W entry.</td>', 'There is a lot of texture here.  I don''t think this was a good challenge to make a B&W entry.', '2010-08-29 10:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144314, 904850, 110876, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this was the challenge to enter a B&amp;W image.  One of the main attributes of rust is the red color.</td>', 'I don''t think this was the challenge to enter a B&W image.  One of the main attributes of rust is the red color.', '2010-08-29 10:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144316, 903995, 110876, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on here.  If this was not a challenge on rust, I would have thought the background was just red paint.</td>', 'There is a lot going on here.  If this was not a challenge on rust, I would have thought the background was just red paint.', '2010-08-29 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144318, 905009, 110876, '<td valign="top">This would be a great picture if you cropped out the rusty old truck.  ;)</td>', 'This would be a great picture if you cropped out the rusty old truck.  ;)', '2010-08-29 10:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144341, 904510, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice forms. Interesting use of DOF. I wonder if I would have done it this way.</td>', 'Nice forms. Interesting use of DOF. I wonder if I would have done it this way.', '2010-08-29 11:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144343, 904406, 76335, '<td valign="top">Spider web as leading lines. Sort of. Nice job.</td>', 'Spider web as leading lines. Sort of. Nice job.', '2010-08-29 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144345, 904635, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I like the subject isolation.</td>', 'Beautiful. I like the subject isolation.', '2010-08-29 11:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144346, 904664, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, good work with the lighting (strobe?).</td>', 'Nice lines, good work with the lighting (strobe?).', '2010-08-29 11:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144349, 904981, 76335, '<td valign="top">Get closer, experiment with different angles, lighting. A nice subject, but the image needs something more.</td>', 'Get closer, experiment with different angles, lighting. A nice subject, but the image needs something more.', '2010-08-29 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144350, 904495, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well seen, beautifully executed.</td>', 'Well seen, beautifully executed.', '2010-08-29 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144352, 904966, 76335, '<td valign="top">What better thing could he have landed on?</td>', 'What better thing could he have landed on?', '2010-08-29 12:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144353, 905003, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like it against the backdrop of green. Good contrasting textures.</td>', 'I like it against the backdrop of green. Good contrasting textures.', '2010-08-29 12:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144355, 904690, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ll spare you how I feel about this type of processing. I will say that I love the composition. Rust comes alive!</td>', 'I''ll spare you how I feel about this type of processing. I will say that I love the composition. Rust comes alive!', '2010-08-29 12:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144356, 904875, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, effective use of thirds.</td>', 'Nicely composed, effective use of thirds.', '2010-08-29 12:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144357, 904350, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and nicely framed. The lighting is a little dull.</td>', 'Nice subject and nicely framed. The lighting is a little dull.', '2010-08-29 12:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144358, 904967, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and I like the low, wide angle.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and I like the low, wide angle.', '2010-08-29 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144361, 904062, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks so pitiful behind bars!</td>', 'Looks so pitiful behind bars!', '2010-08-29 12:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144363, 904592, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great title, interesting composition.</td>', 'Great title, interesting composition.', '2010-08-29 12:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144381, 905004, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the rich colors in this.</td>', 'I do like the rich colors in this.', '2010-08-29 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144382, 904819, 76335, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the narrow DOF is buying you much here. I would like to have seen them all in focus. Good subject, in any case.</td>', 'I don''t think the narrow DOF is buying you much here. I would like to have seen them all in focus. Good subject, in any case.', '2010-08-29 12:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144387, 904999, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice. The tilt is a bit distracting though in that it keeps pulling my eye from your subject and to the horizon.</td>', 'Nice. The tilt is a bit distracting though in that it keeps pulling my eye from your subject and to the horizon.', '2010-08-29 12:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144440, 904955, 117314, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. What a great way to build a beautiful picture around the rusted subject!</td>', 'This is a nice shot. What a great way to build a beautiful picture around the rusted subject!', '2010-08-29 13:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144587, 904830, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in this. Good rhythm too.</td>', 'Nice detail in this. Good rhythm too.', '2010-08-29 17:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144589, 904687, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels like you missed the focus. More DOF, or different placement of the focus, would have helped, I think.</td>', 'Feels like you missed the focus. More DOF, or different placement of the focus, would have helped, I think.', '2010-08-29 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144590, 904540, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful with the warm, rich tones.</td>', 'Beautiful with the warm, rich tones.', '2010-08-29 17:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144602, 904852, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lots of rust here (in Pittsburgh). Certainly I could have found something to enter. Nice shot of the Ft. Wayne railroad bridge.</td>', 'Lots of rust here (in Pittsburgh). Certainly I could have found something to enter. Nice shot of the Ft. Wayne railroad bridge.', '2010-08-29 18:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144629, 905012, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''m on your side of the argument but a powerful piece of work and very well photographed too.</td>', 'I''m not sure I''m on your side of the argument but a powerful piece of work and very well photographed too.', '2010-08-29 19:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144635, 904579, 112292, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite entries in this challenge.</td>', 'One of my favorite entries in this challenge.', '2010-08-29 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144637, 905011, 112292, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and contrast.</td>', 'Nice colors and contrast.', '2010-08-29 19:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144638, 904583, 112292, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Well done.', '2010-08-29 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144640, 904842, 112292, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of the sky and the details in the clouds.</td>', 'I love the colors of the sky and the details in the clouds.', '2010-08-29 19:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144671, 904849, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have a great photo here, but the white sky kind of blows. It really sucks when we only have so much time to get the shot and we have to work with the elements as they are presented. You did very well with the color and exposure here... I also like the perspective shot from. Perhaps with the white sky, it would be better to frame the photo so it is mostly cropped out.</td>', 'You have a great photo here, but the white sky kind of blows. It really sucks when we only have so much time to get the shot and we have to work with the elements as they are presented. You did very well with the color and exposure here... I also like the perspective shot from. Perhaps with the white sky, it would be better to frame the photo so it is mostly cropped out.', '2010-08-29 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144673, 905002, 10785, '<td valign="top">This has a real purple hue to it. It my be something with the color temperature being a bit too cool...</td>', 'This has a real purple hue to it. It my be something with the color temperature being a bit too cool...', '2010-08-29 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144678, 904759, 10785, '<td valign="top">So what happened?? Did you share a tripod??</td>', 'So what happened?? Did you share a tripod??', '2010-08-29 20:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144685, 904655, 10785, '<td valign="top">A real cool title for this shot would hav been "Acid Washed". I like it a lot.</td>', 'A real cool title for this shot would hav been "Acid Washed". I like it a lot.', '2010-08-29 20:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144686, 904954, 10785, '<td valign="top">So what happened?? Did you share a tripod??</td>', 'So what happened?? Did you share a tripod??', '2010-08-29 20:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144749, 904101, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in sepia.</td>', 'Beautiful in sepia.', '2010-08-29 21:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144755, 905009, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, but it doesn''t look terribly rusted or abandoned.</td>', 'Nice photograph, but it doesn''t look terribly rusted or abandoned.', '2010-08-29 21:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144766, 904823, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the narrow DOF half on the nailhead.</td>', 'Not sure I like the narrow DOF half on the nailhead.', '2010-08-29 22:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144777, 905018, 76335, '<td valign="top">Blurry grainy blades. The quality leaves something to be desired, though I don''t find the end result to be all that inaccessible. It has a certain appeal to it.</td>', 'Blurry grainy blades. The quality leaves something to be desired, though I don''t find the end result to be all that inaccessible. It has a certain appeal to it.', '2010-08-29 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144779, 904522, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lighting. Focus.</td>', 'Lighting. Focus.', '2010-08-29 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144789, 904955, 76335, '<td valign="top">Such tension between the two. Very original.</td>', 'Such tension between the two. Very original.', '2010-08-29 22:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144791, 904467, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting here isn''t very flattering. Also it looks blurred or slightly out of focus.</td>', 'The lighting here isn''t very flattering. Also it looks blurred or slightly out of focus.', '2010-08-29 22:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144793, 904958, 76335, '<td valign="top">For me, it''s the missing hoop that gives this such impact.</td>', 'For me, it''s the missing hoop that gives this such impact.', '2010-08-29 22:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144794, 904691, 76335, '<td valign="top">Hello.</td>', 'Hello.', '2010-08-29 22:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144797, 904795, 76335, '<td valign="top">A very interesting if slightly twisted still life.</td>', 'A very interesting if slightly twisted still life.', '2010-08-29 22:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144799, 903938, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the garish colors, but I''m sure someone will.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the garish colors, but I''m sure someone will.', '2010-08-29 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144802, 904658, 76335, '<td valign="top">My gut instinct says to go even tighter on the framing and abstract to full effect, or back off and show us some context.</td>', 'My gut instinct says to go even tighter on the framing and abstract to full effect, or back off and show us some context.', '2010-08-29 22:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144803, 904811, 76335, '<td valign="top">What else could he be called?</td>', 'What else could he be called?', '2010-08-29 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144815, 904812, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting sky. Is there a-storm-a-brewin'', or did you darken it, I wonder.</td>', 'Interesting sky. Is there a-storm-a-brewin'', or did you darken it, I wonder.', '2010-08-29 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144820, 904352, 76335, '<td valign="top">The first one I''ve looked at, and it''s beautiful. Great colors, textures, and abstract to full effect.</td>', 'The first one I''ve looked at, and it''s beautiful. Great colors, textures, and abstract to full effect.', '2010-08-29 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144821, 904867, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. Looks like it was shot at sunrise. The lighting is sublime. I love the all the subtle (and not so subtle) irony.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful. Looks like it was shot at sunrise. The lighting is sublime. I love the all the subtle (and not so subtle) irony.', '2010-08-29 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144822, 905000, 76335, '<td valign="top">Images like these are the whole reason I''m even voting/commenting this challenge. A top pick from me easily.</td>', 'Images like these are the whole reason I''m even voting/commenting this challenge. A top pick from me easily.', '2010-08-29 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144824, 904466, 76335, '<td valign="top">It''s that little bit of spider web silk that, well, "nails it" for me. Nice.</td>', 'It''s that little bit of spider web silk that, well, "nails it" for me. Nice.', '2010-08-29 22:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144825, 904759, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice wide angle, works well against the backdrop of brick.</td>', 'Nice wide angle, works well against the backdrop of brick.', '2010-08-29 22:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144826, 904705, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous detail!</td>', 'Fabulous detail!', '2010-08-29 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144827, 904815, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Can we call this a still life? I love it.</td>', 'Beautiful. Can we call this a still life? I love it.', '2010-08-29 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144828, 904627, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones in this.</td>', 'Lovely tones in this.', '2010-08-29 22:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144829, 905016, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract framing.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract framing.', '2010-08-29 22:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144830, 903914, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen. The color and quietness of this reminds me of Eggleston.</td>', 'Beautifully seen. The color and quietness of this reminds me of Eggleston.', '2010-08-29 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144831, 904549, 76335, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal. Nicely done.</td>', 'Phenomenal. Nicely done.', '2010-08-29 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144832, 905015, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Looks like a volcano gone bad on a snowy peak.</td>', 'Very cool. Looks like a volcano gone bad on a snowy peak.', '2010-08-29 22:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144833, 904877, 76335, '<td valign="top">An effective composition. Feels very uninviting.</td>', 'An effective composition. Feels very uninviting.', '2010-08-29 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6144834, 905012, 76335, '<td valign="top">Brave.</td>', 'Brave.', '2010-08-29 22:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144835, 903995, 76335, '<td valign="top">Back to bump this a point. Bright and bold. I like it.</td>', 'Back to bump this a point. Bright and bold. I like it.', '2010-08-29 22:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144836, 904410, 76335, '<td valign="top">Indeed it does. A rust bug. Very impressive.</td>', 'Indeed it does. A rust bug. Very impressive.', '2010-08-29 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144837, 904236, 76335, '<td valign="top">The composition is perfect to my eyes, and the colors complement each other effectively.</td>', 'The composition is perfect to my eyes, and the colors complement each other effectively.', '2010-08-29 22:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144838, 904665, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lots of impact here. Great lighting. An eight for you.</td>', 'Lots of impact here. Great lighting. An eight for you.', '2010-08-29 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144839, 904850, 76335, '<td valign="top">Was this flashed? Whatever you did gives it a stark, chilling quality. Very grim. And brilliant in black and white. (I could have done without all the poetry in the title, but whatever.)</td>', 'Was this flashed? Whatever you did gives it a stark, chilling quality. Very grim. And brilliant in black and white. (I could have done without all the poetry in the title, but whatever.)', '2010-08-29 22:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144840, 904424, 76335, '<td valign="top">A dumpster? I love dumpsters for this reason. Very ominous.</td>', 'A dumpster? I love dumpsters for this reason. Very ominous.', '2010-08-29 22:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144841, 904576, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bumping this to a seven. Nicely composed with great twists, textures and tones.</td>', 'Bumping this to a seven. Nicely composed with great twists, textures and tones.', '2010-08-29 22:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144842, 904524, 76335, '<td valign="top">Now <i>that''s</i> original. Beautifully conceived and executed.</td>', 'Now that''s original. Beautifully conceived and executed.', '2010-08-29 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144843, 905001, 76335, '<td valign="top">A whole new world revealed. Nice macro.</td>', 'A whole new world revealed. Nice macro.', '2010-08-29 22:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144844, 904655, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is so weird, I can''t help but keep staring at it.</td>', 'This is so weird, I can''t help but keep staring at it.', '2010-08-29 22:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144845, 905005, 76335, '<td valign="top">I see a biblical scene. Amazing. Best of show. A ten for you.</td>', 'I see a biblical scene. Amazing. Best of show. A ten for you.', '2010-08-29 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144887, 904795, 54033, '<td valign="top">Excellento 10</td>', 'Excellento 10', '2010-08-29 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6144960, 904690, 37845, '<td valign="top">Great finish Nick, I love how there isnt a single score below 5. I wonder if that has ever happened on this site :)</td>', 'Great finish Nick, I love how there isnt a single score below 5. I wonder if that has ever happened on this site :)', '2010-08-30 01:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144961, 904949, 44877, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Glad to see it''s yours. We''re pretty close together again. Wish it could have been a 6 for both of us.</td>', 'I really like this! Glad to see it''s yours. We''re pretty close together again. Wish it could have been a 6 for both of us.', '2010-08-30 01:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144972, 904842, 34938, '<td valign="top">This HAD to win...excellent and congrats</td>', 'This HAD to win...excellent and congrats', '2010-08-30 01:08:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144981, 904867, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like you got a new #2 out of this! Congrats! Well deserving, it was an 8 for me.</td>', 'Looks like you got a new #2 out of this! Congrats! Well deserving, it was an 8 for me.', '2010-08-30 01:11:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144983, 904691, 88850, '<td valign="top">This made me smile!</td>', 'This made me smile!', '2010-08-30 01:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144992, 904658, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like you rotated your profile page with this one. That always makes for a good end to a challenge!</td>', 'Looks like you rotated your profile page with this one. That always makes for a good end to a challenge!', '2010-08-30 01:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6144999, 904953, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good showing, though I had actually anticipated this would make it into the low 6''s. One can never really tell.</td>', 'A good showing, though I had actually anticipated this would make it into the low 6''s. One can never really tell.', '2010-08-30 01:16:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145000, 904477, 100831, '<td valign="top">Good one, Lydia!</td>', 'Good one, Lydia!', '2010-08-30 01:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145002, 904579, 37845, '<td valign="top">I didnt recognize this as an HDR until I read your notes. Very nicely, and subtly processed. Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'I didnt recognize this as an HDR until I read your notes. Very nicely, and subtly processed. Congrats on the ribbon.', '2010-08-30 01:18:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145005, 904583, 37845, '<td valign="top">You have incredible dedication towards building your photo setups. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'You have incredible dedication towards building your photo setups. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon.', '2010-08-30 01:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145010, 904955, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice job, and that was a good trick too.  I have done similar shots using 300mm and a 15mm fisheye, but with an in camera double exposure.  <br/>There is a bit of a distraction that the moon is in front of the cloud in this one.</td>', 'Nice job, and that was a good trick too.  I have done similar shots using 300mm and a 15mm fisheye, but with an in camera double exposure.  There is a bit of a distraction that the moon is in front of the cloud in this one.', '2010-08-30 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145011, 905012, 83313, '<td valign="top">Regardless of one''s stance on abortion, I thought this was an excellent use of the topic and I gave it a 9. I see you got slammed as expected. Deserved much better for being a technically good entry and making a strong point with it.</td>', 'Regardless of one''s stance on abortion, I thought this was an excellent use of the topic and I gave it a 9. I see you got slammed as expected. Deserved much better for being a technically good entry and making a strong point with it.', '2010-08-30 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145012, 904842, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice work</td>', 'Very nice work', '2010-08-30 01:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6145013, 904583, 96751, '<td valign="top">What <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=37845" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">VitaminB</a> said!!!  I am constantly amazed by your dedication and perseverance.  Fabulous work.  No wonder you''re always on the front page.  At the top :-)</td>', 'What  VitaminB said!!!  I am constantly amazed by your dedication and perseverance.  Fabulous work.  No wonder you''re always on the front page.  At the top :-)', '2010-08-30 01:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
