(6145081, 904484, 75618, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the wonderful comment, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60173" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aliqui</a>. I think people were expecting a "topazed" kind of approach in processing.  I intentionally shot this at f1.8 to create the bokeh/colors that would complement the rust. I''m glad at least a couple people appreciated it though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-30 01:43:53.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the wonderful comment,  aliqui. I think people were expecting a "topazed" kind of approach in processing.  I intentionally shot this at f1.8 to create the bokeh/colors that would complement the rust. I''m glad at least a couple people appreciated it though.', '2010-08-30 02:43:13.000000', '2010-08-30 02:43:53.000000', 0),
