(6145121, 905015, 111519, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the kind comments!<br/> <br/>I try to be clever and avoid shots that are too obvious or cliche so I''m glad this worked well for a number of people.<br/> <br/>This was my first DPC entry and I had a nice time hiking out to get the shot, wearing out the Update button and following the discussions in the forums the following week ;^)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the kind comments! I try to be clever and avoid shots that are too obvious or cliche so I''m glad this worked well for a number of people. This was my first DPC entry and I had a nice time hiking out to get the shot, wearing out the Update button and following the discussions in the forums the following week ;^)', '2010-08-30 04:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
