(6145340, 905015, 65319, '<td valign="top">Hey Will!  Congrats on your first entry!  Well done!  I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=15711" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jutilda</a> about the cone bra...which always reminds me of the singer Madonna some how!  The DOF really works well here in the pattern of cones for a unique composition. Looking forward to seeing many more of your entries!  Welcome to DPC!!!</td>', 'Hey Will!  Congrats on your first entry!  Well done!  I agree with  Jutilda about the cone bra...which always reminds me of the singer Madonna some how!  The DOF really works well here in the pattern of cones for a unique composition. Looking forward to seeing many more of your entries!  Welcome to DPC!!!', '2010-08-30 10:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
