(6145506, 905012, 49954, '<td valign="top">Wow...  (My membership has lapsed, so I cannot edit details)...<br/> <br/>Impressed this moved up above 5.000  Had a couple of last minute 1s that knocked it from a 5.09 high.  Also impressed at the folks who disagreed with the concept, but appreciated the photo and voted it well.  To be honest, I don''t know if I could have done the same had the subject been pro-abortion.  So kudos to those of you that could.  Very honorable.<br/> <br/>I wanted the white background on purpose to show the rust, but also give a clinical feel.  It seems to have paid off.<br/> <br/>Not has many hater comments as I expected.  I fully expected to get lambasted for this.  :)</td>', 'Wow...  (My membership has lapsed, so I cannot edit details)... Impressed this moved up above 5.000  Had a couple of last minute 1s that knocked it from a 5.09 high.  Also impressed at the folks who disagreed with the concept, but appreciated the photo and voted it well.  To be honest, I don''t know if I could have done the same had the subject been pro-abortion.  So kudos to those of you that could.  Very honorable. I wanted the white background on purpose to show the rust, but also give a clinical feel.  It seems to have paid off. Not has many hater comments as I expected.  I fully expected to get lambasted for this.  :)', '2010-08-30 13:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
