(6145998, 904812, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ammie:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting sky. Is there a-storm-a-brewin'', or did you darken it, I wonder. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>No, no storm , but a strong westerly and very dusty wind prevailed. Good photographs were hard to get. The dark sky is dust and more dust. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks. Really nice work.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ammie: Originally posted by bvy: Interesting sky. Is there a-storm-a-brewin'', or did you darken it, I wonder.  No, no storm , but a strong westerly and very dusty wind prevailed. Good photographs were hard to get. The dark sky is dust and more dust.  Thanks. Really nice work.', '2010-08-30 21:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
